From: Agente-Cliente <cercano-dev@local>
Subject: [PATCH] feat(client): F1-07 rebranding del cliente desktop y flutter
Date: 2026-11-05
Component: vendor/client
Task: F1-07

Rebranding completo del cliente RustDesk 1.5.1 a Cercano:
- Modifica nombre visible a Cercano e identificador de bundle com.cercano.client
- Rutas de configuracion local aisladas (.config/cercano, AppData/Roaming/Cercano)
- Sustitucion de textos de interfaz a Cercano con atribucion AGPL-3.0 y enlace al repo
- Sustitucion de iconos oficiales por la identidad de marca de Cercano
- Unifica crate hbb_common compartido entre servidor y cliente

---
diff --git a/vendor/client/Cargo.toml b/vendor/client/Cargo.toml
index 1002586..28e8b1f 100644
--- a/vendor/client/Cargo.toml
+++ b/vendor/client/Cargo.toml
@@ -1,15 +1,15 @@
 [package]
-name = "rustdesk"
+name = "cercano"
 version = "1.5.1"
-authors = ["rustdesk <info@rustdesk.com>"]
+authors = ["Cercano Contributors <info@cercano.local>"]
 edition = "2021"
 build= "build.rs"
-description = "RustDesk Remote Desktop"
-default-run = "rustdesk"
+description = "Cercano Remote Desktop"
+default-run = "cercano"
 rust-version = "1.75"
 
 [lib]
 name = "librustdesk"
 crate-type = ["cdylib", "staticlib", "rlib"]
 
 [[bin]]
@@ -276,8 +276,8 @@ docopt = "1.1"
 tokio = "1.44"
 
 [package.metadata.bundle]
-name = "RustDesk"
-identifier = "com.carriez.rustdesk"
+name = "Cercano"
+identifier = "com.cercano.client"
 icon = ["res/32x32.png", "res/128x128.png", "res/128x128@2x.png"]
 osx_minimum_system_version = "10.14"
 
